For each issue, record severity, affected module, failure/security scenario, remediation, test and owner. Prioritize critical security/privacy issues, data loss, unauthorized access, unsupported ingredient findings, crashes, scalability, cost and UX.

Gate: Do not assume the prototype's stack or gaps. Base the implementation plan on repository evidence.
